At least there are two things that will be on the agenda of the Trans Pacific Partnership that deregulation of export-import, which means expansion of markets and the flow of investment easier.
The decision whether or not to join the Trans Pacific Partnership should be based on the strength of Indonesia in ASEAN as well as support the development of maritime infrastructure.
